                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "garybeihl",
                        "email": "garybeihl@microsoft.com",
                        "username": "garybeihl"
                    },
                    "message": "PS4: rewrote per review \u2014 replaced raw SSL_set1_host with Boost Asio ssl::host_name_verification + set_verify_callback, which is the idiomatic wrapper over the same X509_check_host primitive.\n\nTested: block updated with full Renode phase1/phase2 E2E evidence (phase1 reproduces the MITM bug on unfixed bmcweb; phase2 shows all three scenarios pass with this patch). PS3 failed CI on a minor format issue that PS4 fixes (whitespace only, no behavioral change)."
                }
